{"title":"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of solutions, in degrees, to the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/8/4e87716122156659c15b00a552e11da241e943ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^{10}x + \\cos^{10}x = \\frac{29}{16}\\cos^4 2x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"231\" height=\"38\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/2/582200cb8c1ce43c79665847615c708b9bc5a9b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0^\\circ \\le x^\\circ \\le 2007^\\circ.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/9/e197f4d09c7e737eaf99b1a0c44571bf656b2d64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos2x=2\\cos^2x-1=1-2\\sin^2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"270\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/b/ddbc827e4ea37c93dc990611828f6a6a7b9856cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^{10}x+\\cos^{10}x=\\left(\\frac{1-\\cos2x}2\\right)^5+\\left(\\frac{1+\\cos2x}2\\right)^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"400\" height=\"46\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/9/4598506a013f729a5609c198e71a7523a6bdcaca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2(1+\\binom52\\cos^22x+\\binom 54\\cos^42x)}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"258\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/790fca081574de678ca97b62c2cc8620e7dd01f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+10\\cos^22x+5\\cos^42x}{16}=\\frac{29}{16}\\cos^42x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"302\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>On Simplification, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/c/5ac046a6d0b0b7912ac9ae9cba1644548272098e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24\\cos^42x-10\\cos^22x-1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"237\" height=\"15\" /> which is a quadratic equation in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/4/c34219d128d46df95ce577f1351bedc6998df9b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^22x$\" width=\"54\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/9/6096f16f79c1218c16dbae2e6a95ade0694740d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^22x=\\frac{10\\pm \\sqrt{10^2-4\\cdot24\\cdot(-1)}}{2\\cdot24}=\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"315\" height=\"41\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/8/bf8c474f923f06731862816770c33697174bbc53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac1{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"34\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is real, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9adca92248f020c36b101c14da06f20215545119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le\\cos^22x\\le1\\implies \\cos^22x=\\frac12\\implies 2\\cos^22x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"410\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/8/a38bba04b0d40d069645162837c3ebc780a3bfea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos4x=0\\implies 4x=(2n+1)90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"259\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/950479e9f470cd9ca74fa9aa092ae973b851aa29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=(2n+1)22.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is any integer.\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aa51506c80f5b73e1f50eb50fe4b5d74814b5bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le \\frac{(2n+1)90}4\\le2007\\implies -\\frac12\\le n\\le \\frac{882}{20}=44.1\\implies 0\\le n\\le44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"541\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 2 2006-2007</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t={{{source}}}\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Pr